  "body": "I have been investigating the following UISI report :https://github.com/matrix-org/element-web-rageshakes/issues/6602\r\n\r\nIt looks like a gappy sync scenario, and that the membership event was not sent\r\n<img width=\"967\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9841565/137699110-05a00f77-1e90-4a4e-884f-0fcb71022204.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nThe join event of the receiver was only received when he sent is first message in the room (he actually joined 5h before)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n",
